{"synopsis":"Leon seorang mantan pekerja Jepang bereinkarnasi menjadi dunia otome game dan putus asa melihat dunia di mana perempuan mendominasi lakilaki Seolaholah lakilaki hanyalah hewan ternak yang menjadi batu loncatan bagi perempuan di dunia ini Satusatunya pengecualian adalah target romantis game tersebut sekelompok pria tampan yang dipimpin oleh putra mahkota Dalam keadaan aneh ini Leon memegang satu senjata pengetahuannya dari dunia sebelumnya di mana saudara perempuannya yang kurang ajar memaksanya untuk menyelesaikan permainan ini Ini adalah kisah tentang petualangannya untuk bertahan dan berkembang di dunia ini","alternative_title":"Trapped in a Dating Sim: The World of Otome Games Is Tough for Mobs","author":"Shiosato Jun","artist":"Mishima Yomu","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"1d35f820-bba6-4697-9b92-4ccd3dd418ab","number":"75","chapter":"75","title":"","date":"2026-02-15","released":"2026-02-15"},{"chapter_id":"335660ef-c81b-4837-95f2-e4a0a50b23d8","number":"74","chapter":"74","title":"","date":"2026-01-12","released":"2026-01-12"},{"chapter_id":"38c6c89c-faeb-4d3d-ab3a-d2effaf3272d","number":"73","chapter":"73","title":"","date":"2025-11-10","released":"2025-11-10"},{"chapter_id":"2dd2bd09-023b-4740-a48b-d4e90f5489a3","number":"72","chapter":"72","title":"","date":"2025-10-10","released":"2025-10-10"},{"chapter_id":"7e1da9b4-d8d2-46cd-b9ae-47cc798a699b","number":"71","chapter":"71","title":"","date":"2025-09-10","released":"2025-09-10"},{"chapter_id":"46d232f8-10b9-45af-8dbb-cc95677d9411","number":"70","chapter":"70","title":"","date":"2025-09-10","released":"2025-09-10"},{"chapter_id":"71c52156-a278-4fdd-9d9b-93c5355616ab","number":"69","chapter":"69","title":"","date":"2025-09-10","released":"2025-09-10"},{"chapter_id":"eb30d551-1dc4-4748-b3a9-b3dbf0a6a4be","number":"68","chapter":"68","title":"","date":"2025-09-10","released":"2025-09-10"},{"chapter_id":"85288fbf-2ce5-4c8f-8c16-4878b691551a","number":"67","chapter":"67","title":"","date":"2025-09-10","r